{"slug": "C_S03E13", "video_name": "Community - S03E13 - Digital Exploration of Interior Design (1) Bluray-1080p Proper.mkv", "subtitle_name": "Community - S03E13 - Digital Exploration of Interior Design (1) Bluray-1080p Proper.en.srt", "duration_seconds": 1280.965, "language": "en", "stt_provider": "local", "stt_model": "ggml-small.en-q5_1.bin", "segment_count": 570, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 4.508307692307692, "text": "This is a historic day for Greendale."}, {"start": 4.508307692307692, "end": 7.92, "text": "This state of the art subway"}, {"start": 7.92, "end": 13.8, "text": "sandwichery in our cafeteria represents Greendale's first steps forward into the"}, {"start": 13.8, "end": 15.52051948051948, "text": "realm of the legitimate."}, {"start": 15.52051948051948, "end": 16.524155844155842, "text": "Oh no problem."}, {"start": 16.524155844155842, "end": 19.32, "text": "You know what I'm saying get it started"}, {"start": 19.32, "end": 20.421935483870968, "text": "with my teeth."}, {"start": 20.421935483870968, "end": 21.60258064516129, "text": "The legitimate?"}, {"start": 21.60258064516129, "end": 24.121290322580645, "text": "That should be my sandwich shop."}, {"start": 24.121290322580645, "end": 26.64, "text": "It was my idea to put one there."}, {"start": 26.64, "end": 27.749189189189188, "text": "We're here for you Shirley."}, {"start": 27.749189189189188, "end": 29.68, "text": "Yeah Troy Annie and I know what it's like to be"}, {"start": 29.68, "end": 30.085479452054795, "text": "displaced."}, {"start": 30.085479452054795, "end": 32.51835616438356, "text": "They're tenting our building for termites so we're homeless."}, {"start": 32.51835616438356, "end": 32.64, "text": "I'm"}, {"start": 32.64, "end": 33.818, "text": "staying in the sleep study lab."}, {"start": 33.818, "end": 35.68, "text": "All I have to do is wake up every three hours and"}, {"start": 35.68, "end": 37.16101265822785, "text": "go and I get two credits."}, {"start": 37.16101265822785, "end": 40.36, "text": "Yeah and we're gonna build a super awesome pillow fort"}, {"start": 40.36, "end": 41.187341772151896, "text": "here at the school."}, {"start": 41.187341772151896, "end": 42.05822784810126, "text": "Another pillow fort?"}, {"start": 42.05822784810126, "end": 43.8, "text": "Kind of repeating yourselves aren't you?"}, {"start": 43.8, "end": 45.123243243243245, "text": "That was a blanket fort."}, {"start": 45.123243243243245, "end": 46.611891891891894, "text": "This will be a pillow fort."}, {"start": 46.611891891891894, "end": 47.88, "text": "Way more difficult, way"}, {"start": 47.88, "end": 48.189473684210526, "text": "better."}, {"start": 48.189473684210526, "end": 51.24, "text": "All difficult things are better like carrying a disease or holding in"}, {"start": 51.24, "end": 52.10586666666667, "text": "a fart right now."}, {"start": 52.10586666666667, "end": 52.3096, "text": "Aha!"}, {"start": 52.3096, "end": 55.06, "text": "I just found out how Shirley and I are gonna take down"}, {"start": 55.06, "end": 55.59918918918919, "text": "Subway."}, {"start": 55.59918918918919, "end": 56.13837837837838, "text": "Oh how?"}, {"start": 56.13837837837838, "end": 60.45189189189189, "text": "Dean I assume you're familiar with the Greendale bylaws?"}, {"start": 60.45189189189189, "end": 60.76, "text": "I am"}, {"start": 60.76, "end": 60.96658227848101, "text": "not."}, {"start": 60.96658227848101, "end": 62.309367088607594, "text": "Shirley you do the honors."}, {"start": 62.309367088607594, "end": 64.84, "text": "My brain starts getting weird this time of night."}, {"start": 64.84, "end": 65.8208695652174, "text": "It's 10 a.m."}, {"start": 65.8208695652174, "end": 67.04695652173913, "text": "You're welcome."}, {"start": 67.04695652173913, "end": 67.53739130434784, "text": "Uh-oh."}, {"start": 67.53739130434784, "end": 70.48, "text": "Any business operating for profit on"}, {"start": 70.48, "end": 74.92, "text": "Greendale's campus must be at least 51% owned by a registered Greendale student."}, {"start": 74.92, "end": 76.15478260869565, "text": "That's too bad Dean."}, {"start": 76.15478260869565, "end": 79.18, "text": "I don't recall seeing Subway in my pre-menopausal"}, {"start": 79.18, "end": 82.0428947368421, "text": "post-feminist experiential marketing class."}, {"start": 82.0428947368421, "end": 84.24, "text": "Actually I'm on the wait list for"}, {"start": 84.24, "end": 86.13924050632912, "text": "the pre-men post-feminist mark."}, {"start": 86.13924050632912, "end": 86.87443037974684, "text": "Who are you?"}, {"start": 86.87443037974684, "end": 89.08, "text": "Gang meet Greendale's newest student"}, {"start": 89.08, "end": 89.6178947368421, "text": "Subway."}, {"start": 89.6178947368421, "end": 91.15473684210527, "text": "Your name is Subway."}, {"start": 91.15473684210527, "end": 94.92, "text": "Yep using a groundbreaking but surprisingly legal"}, {"start": 94.92, "end": 98.76, "text": "process known as corporal humanization real people such as myself are now"}, {"start": 98.76, "end": 101.90514285714286, "text": "allowed to represent the collective humanity of business owners."}, {"start": 101.90514285714286, "end": 102.2, "text": "I have"}, {"start": 102.2, "end": 108.04, "text": "contractually waived my birth identity and am now a man and students named"}, {"start": 108.04, "end": 108.62986666666667, "text": "Subway."}, {"start": 108.62986666666667, "end": 110.39946666666667, "text": "I don't believe this."}, {"start": 110.39946666666667, "end": 114.36, "text": "Come on Subway there is no way you're five ten."}, {"start": 114.36, "end": 115.60666666666667, "text": "Sir you can vote?"}, {"start": 115.60666666666667, "end": 119.42, "text": "Actually no because technically I'm only a week old."}, {"start": 119.42, "end": 119.64, "text": "But"}, {"start": 119.64, "end": 122.34613333333333, "text": "please don't think of me as any less human than yourselves."}, {"start": 122.34613333333333, "end": 123.08, "text": "I'm here to hang"}, {"start": 123.08, "end": 127.49351351351352, "text": "out take weird classes and party as hardy as my morality clause allows."}, {"start": 127.49351351351352, "end": 127.68, "text": "Eat"}, {"start": 127.68, "end": 128.2272, "text": "fresh?"}, {"start": 128.2272, "end": 129.13920000000002, "text": "Eat fresh?"}, {"start": 129.13920000000002, "end": 130.05120000000002, "text": "Eat fresh."}, {"start": 130.05120000000002, "end": 131.32800000000003, "text": "That's my man."}, {"start": 131.32800000000003, "end": 134.52, "text": "Wow did you know Greendale students"}, {"start": 134.52, "end": 138.31123287671232, "text": "are technically in the army reserves?"}, {"start": 138.31123287671232, "end": 142.0, "text": "Let's say a little prayer for peace."}, {"start": 164.52, "end": 169.05866666666665, "text": "Annie you've got to get me into the sleep lab."}, {"start": 169.05866666666665, "end": 171.92, "text": "I can't think of a better use"}, {"start": 171.92, "end": 173.81279999999998, "text": "of my time here than being unconscious."}, {"start": 173.81279999999998, "end": 175.56, "text": "It's not a blow-off class Jeff we're"}, {"start": 175.56, "end": 181.06425000000002, "text": "only allowed to bring one stuffed animal."}, {"start": 181.06425000000002, "end": 183.74925000000002, "text": "I'm bringing Ruthie."}, {"start": 183.74925000000002, "end": 185.76300000000003, "text": "We'll have fun."}, {"start": 185.76300000000003, "end": 186.3, "text": "Wait"}, {"start": 186.3, "end": 188.70769230769233, "text": "since when do we have lockers?"}, {"start": 188.70769230769233, "end": 191.19564102564104, "text": "Uh since registration day 2009."}, {"start": 191.19564102564104, "end": 192.56, "text": "Jeff did you skip"}, {"start": 192.56, "end": 196.57081081081083, "text": "the pre-orientation freshman welcome seminar on diversity fire circle?"}, {"start": 196.57081081081083, "end": 196.8, "text": "This"}, {"start": 196.8, "end": 198.15, "text": "explains so much about you."}, {"start": 198.15, "end": 200.4, "text": "Are you saying I've had a locker here for two"}, {"start": 200.4, "end": 202.96, "text": "and a half years?"}, {"start": 205.2, "end": 206.36666666666665, "text": "Whoa whoa wow."}, {"start": 206.36666666666665, "end": 212.0333333333333, "text": "Halloween dance, post Halloween dance, dance contest, contest dance."}, {"start": 212.0333333333333, "end": 212.2, "text": "Oh"}, {"start": 212.2, "end": 212.77513513513512, "text": "come on."}, {"start": 212.77513513513512, "end": 213.63783783783782, "text": "What's this?"}, {"start": 213.63783783783782, "end": 214.64432432432432, "text": "Saved Garrett?"}, {"start": 214.64432432432432, "end": 216.51351351351352, "text": "What's wrong with Garrett?"}, {"start": 216.51351351351352, "end": 217.37621621621622, "text": "Nothing now."}, {"start": 217.37621621621622, "end": 217.52, "text": "We"}, {"start": 217.52, "end": 218.48962025316456, "text": "saved him."}, {"start": 218.48962025316456, "end": 221.0106329113924, "text": "Wait that's saved Garrett?"}, {"start": 221.0106329113924, "end": 222.17417721518987, "text": "What's this?"}, {"start": 222.17417721518987, "end": 223.33772151898734, "text": "Love letter?"}, {"start": 223.33772151898734, "end": 225.85873417721518, "text": "It's probably one of many."}, {"start": 225.85873417721518, "end": 228.57367088607594, "text": "Oh no this is a hate letter."}, {"start": 228.57367088607594, "end": 229.05848101265823, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 229.05848101265823, "end": 230.60987341772153, "text": "Let me see that."}, {"start": 230.60987341772153, "end": 232.84, "text": "Dear Jeff this may come"}, {"start": 232.84, "end": 235.56, "text": "as a shock to someone who thinks he's God's gift to the world but you're"}, {"start": 235.56, "end": 238.18, "text": "actually an inconsiderate jerk, Kim."}, {"start": 238.18, "end": 239.1988888888889, "text": "Inconsiderate?"}, {"start": 239.1988888888889, "end": 239.92666666666668, "text": "Who's Kim?"}, {"start": 239.92666666666668, "end": 240.8, "text": "I don't know"}, {"start": 240.8, "end": 244.55696202531647, "text": "clearly she doesn't know me."}, {"start": 244.55696202531647, "end": 246.70379746835445, "text": "I didn't sneeze."}, {"start": 246.70379746835445, "end": 249.52151898734178, "text": "Look at these idiots."}, {"start": 249.52151898734178, "end": 251.4, "text": "Cattle, sheep,"}, {"start": 251.4, "end": 253.79473684210527, "text": "other animals that travel in herds."}, {"start": 253.79473684210527, "end": 255.23157894736843, "text": "I want to say snakes."}, {"start": 255.23157894736843, "end": 256.6, "text": "Am I the only person"}, {"start": 256.6, "end": 260.25217391304346, "text": "enraged by the fact that corporations are taking human form?"}, {"start": 260.25217391304346, "end": 260.8, "text": "I totally"}, {"start": 260.8, "end": 264.14, "text": "predicted this in my high school newspaper column Britta unfiltered."}, {"start": 264.14, "end": 264.93142857142857, "text": "Unfiltered?"}, {"start": 264.93142857142857, "end": 265.57896103896104, "text": "I get it."}, {"start": 265.57896103896104, "end": 266.2264935064935, "text": "Get what?"}, {"start": 266.2264935064935, "end": 269.68, "text": "Actually maybe subway taking human form could be"}, {"start": 269.68, "end": 271.09569620253166, "text": "its undoing."}, {"start": 271.09569620253166, "end": 275.05065702230263, "text": "Britta you're a progressive woman"}, {"start": 275.05065702230263, "end": 278.6460759493671, "text": "of a more liberated looseness."}, {"start": 278.6460759493671, "end": 279.0, "text": "You"}, {"start": 279.0, "end": 281.83684210526314, "text": "could get close to subway and find out some dirt on it."}, {"start": 281.83684210526314, "end": 282.86842105263156, "text": "Corporate espionage."}, {"start": 282.86842105263156, "end": 282.92, "text": "I"}, {"start": 282.92, "end": 283.3812987012987, "text": "like it."}, {"start": 283.3812987012987, "end": 287.36, "text": "Microphones hidden in lipstick lipstick hidden on microphones and the"}, {"start": 287.36, "end": 290.3969230769231, "text": "deadliest weapon of them all the penis flytrap."}, {"start": 290.3969230769231, "end": 292.4, "text": "Okay this conversation is over."}, {"start": 292.4, "end": 296.64, "text": "I am not a whore and not that I've done the math but if I were I'd be the super"}, {"start": 296.64, "end": 301.56, "text": "classy kind that gets flown to Dubai to stay in an underwater hotel."}, {"start": 303.68, "end": 304.03945945945947, "text": "Abed?"}, {"start": 304.03945945945947, "end": 304.3989189189189, "text": "Troy?"}, {"start": 304.3989189189189, "end": 308.85621621621624, "text": "Ah don't worry Dean we have all the proper permits right here."}, {"start": 308.85621621621624, "end": 309.0, "text": "Oh"}, {"start": 309.0, "end": 309.59376623376625, "text": "silly me."}, {"start": 309.59376623376625, "end": 313.0244155844156, "text": "This is a coupon for 20% off at Bed Bath and Beyond."}, {"start": 313.0244155844156, "end": 314.08, "text": "No need to bribe"}, {"start": 314.08, "end": 314.6630136986301, "text": "me Troy."}, {"start": 314.6630136986301, "end": 318.30684931506846, "text": "Actually there's plenty more where that came from."}, {"start": 318.30684931506846, "end": 319.4, "text": "Look I was just"}, {"start": 319.4, "end": 323.32, "text": "googling record lengths of stuff and apparently there's a Guinness World"}, {"start": 323.32, "end": 327.8, "text": "Record for the biggest pillow or blanket for it so you boys you should go for it"}, {"start": 327.8, "end": 329.6935064935065, "text": "put this school on the map."}, {"start": 329.6935064935065, "end": 333.2, "text": "We'd have a better chance of setting the record if"}, {"start": 333.2, "end": 334.496, "text": "we made this a blanket for."}, {"start": 334.496, "end": 335.64799999999997, "text": "You know take less time."}, {"start": 335.64799999999997, "end": 336.56, "text": "We wanted to make a"}, {"start": 336.56, "end": 337.03055555555557, "text": "pillow for."}, {"start": 337.03055555555557, "end": 339.29777777777775, "text": "I don't want to sacrifice quality for square footage."}, {"start": 339.29777777777775, "end": 339.64, "text": "We don't"}, {"start": 339.64, "end": 341.50559999999996, "text": "need a world record to tell us we did something cool."}, {"start": 341.50559999999996, "end": 342.28, "text": "But if we won we might"}, {"start": 342.28, "end": 343.84430769230767, "text": "meet that dude with the curly fingernail."}, {"start": 343.84430769230767, "end": 344.6455384615384, "text": "Should our chill out?"}, {"start": 344.6455384615384, "end": 344.76, "text": "Not"}, {"start": 344.76, "end": 345.5723076923077, "text": "interested."}, {"start": 345.5723076923077, "end": 349.41230769230765, "text": "I saw him on a talk show he came off as pretentious."}, {"start": 349.41230769230765, "end": 350.52, "text": "I'm gonna get a"}, {"start": 350.52, "end": 351.32108108108105, "text": "drink."}, {"start": 351.32108108108105, "end": 351.7216216216216, "text": "OK."}, {"start": 351.7216216216216, "end": 353.32378378378377, "text": "Troy Barnes."}, {"start": 353.32378378378377, "end": 355.46, "text": "Hi Dean Layborn."}, {"start": 355.46, "end": 359.7324324324324, "text": "You have a beard and a ponytail."}, {"start": 359.7324324324324, "end": 360.4, "text": "Going"}, {"start": 360.4, "end": 363.1358974358974, "text": "through some stuff right now Troy don't worry about it."}, {"start": 363.1358974358974, "end": 364.28, "text": "Any chance you've given"}, {"start": 364.28, "end": 367.78506666666664, "text": "a second thought to joining my air conditioning repair school?"}, {"start": 367.78506666666664, "end": 368.52, "text": "Sorry kind of"}, {"start": 368.52, "end": 369.8243243243243, "text": "busy at the moment."}, {"start": 369.8243243243243, "end": 372.1583783783784, "text": "Doing some awesome work with Abed."}, {"start": 372.1583783783784, "end": 373.05081081081084, "text": "Ah yeah Abed."}, {"start": 373.05081081081084, "end": 373.6, "text": "You guys"}, {"start": 373.6, "end": 376.36, "text": "watch that television show together don't you?"}, {"start": 376.36, "end": 377.62, "text": "Inspector Space Time."}, {"start": 377.62, "end": 377.92, "text": "Funny"}, {"start": 377.92, "end": 381.76, "text": "Troy you and Abed have always reminded me of the inspector and his trusty"}, {"start": 381.76, "end": 383.0051948051948, "text": "constable Reggie."}, {"start": 383.0051948051948, "end": 383.37142857142857, "text": "Cool."}, {"start": 383.37142857142857, "end": 387.4, "text": "The inspector of course is smart decisive and Reggie is"}, {"start": 387.4, "end": 388.42233766233767, "text": "well Reggie."}, {"start": 388.42233766233767, "end": 393.96, "text": "Reggie is trained in zero gravity martial arts and has a whistle."}, {"start": 393.96, "end": 399.12, "text": "Yeah but he never really gets to blow the whistle unless the inspector says"}, {"start": 399.12, "end": 399.8158904109589, "text": "it's okay."}, {"start": 399.8158904109589, "end": 404.2, "text": "Less of a friendship more of a self-centered nerd and his naive"}, {"start": 404.2, "end": 406.0768, "text": "obedient lap dog."}, {"start": 406.0768, "end": 409.72, "text": "Well I gotta think you take care."}, {"start": 409.72, "end": 414.16, "text": "Well according to the office this is the locker of the only Kim I've had any"}, {"start": 414.16, "end": 415.6081012658228, "text": "class with since 2009."}, {"start": 415.6081012658228, "end": 418.306835443038, "text": "I wonder what you did to make her so mad."}, {"start": 418.306835443038, "end": 419.36, "text": "Maybe the two of"}, {"start": 419.36, "end": 422.0502564102564, "text": "you made out and then you forgot about her."}, {"start": 422.0502564102564, "end": 424.1774358974359, "text": "Annie that's what you think of me."}, {"start": 424.1774358974359, "end": 424.24, "text": "I"}, {"start": 424.24, "end": 426.45837837837837, "text": "don't make out with forgettable women."}, {"start": 426.45837837837837, "end": 427.33405405405404, "text": "Can I help you?"}, {"start": 427.33405405405404, "end": 428.56, "text": "We're looking for Kim"}, {"start": 428.56, "end": 429.14, "text": "McFadden."}, {"start": 429.14, "end": 430.7511111111111, "text": "This is her locker right?"}, {"start": 430.7511111111111, "end": 431.5244444444444, "text": "You serious?"}, {"start": 431.5244444444444, "end": 433.2, "text": "She slipped a note into my"}, {"start": 433.2, "end": 434.2688888888889, "text": "locker a couple years ago."}, {"start": 434.2688888888889, "end": 435.6255555555556, "text": "I guess I pissed her off somehow."}, {"start": 435.6255555555556, "end": 436.16, "text": "I'm hoping to"}, {"start": 436.16, "end": 437.072, "text": "apologize."}, {"start": 437.072, "end": 439.1696, "text": "That might not be easy."}, {"start": 439.1696, "end": 441.3584, "text": "Kim's no longer with us."}, {"start": 441.3584, "end": 443.0, "text": "She died two weeks"}, {"start": 443.0, "end": 443.2646153846154, "text": "ago."}, {"start": 443.2646153846154, "end": 443.59538461538466, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 443.59538461538466, "end": 447.9615384615385, "text": "Sorry to drop that on you and run but there's a rally for Garrett."}, {"start": 447.9615384615385, "end": 448.16, "text": "But"}, {"start": 448.16, "end": 451.384, "text": "we saved him."}, {"start": 451.384, "end": 453.12, "text": "Did we?"}, {"start": 456.4, "end": 457.77142857142854, "text": "What do you recommend?"}, {"start": 457.77142857142854, "end": 459.57922077922075, "text": "What's it to you meat pusher?"}, {"start": 459.57922077922075, "end": 461.2, "text": "Sounds like you might be a"}, {"start": 461.2, "end": 461.7346835443038, "text": "vegetarian."}, {"start": 461.7346835443038, "end": 463.533164556962, "text": "Should try a Subway's veggie delight."}, {"start": 463.533164556962, "end": 465.04, "text": "You should try reading Orwell's"}, {"start": 465.04, "end": 465.34379746835447, "text": "1984."}, {"start": 465.34379746835447, "end": 465.76911392405066, "text": "I have."}, {"start": 465.76911392405066, "end": 466.8627848101266, "text": "It's a great book."}, {"start": 466.8627848101266, "end": 469.11088607594934, "text": "It really awakened me in high school."}, {"start": 469.11088607594934, "end": 469.84, "text": "I think kids"}, {"start": 469.84, "end": 471.58904109589037, "text": "should be forced to read it."}, {"start": 471.58904109589037, "end": 472.02630136986295, "text": "Me too."}, {"start": 472.02630136986295, "end": 473.52547945205475, "text": "Anyway you're living it."}, {"start": 473.52547945205475, "end": 474.4, "text": "You're a human"}, {"start": 474.4, "end": 476.36571428571426, "text": "puppet with big sandwiches hand up your ass."}, {"start": 476.36571428571426, "end": 477.84, "text": "Is this what you dreamt of being?"}, {"start": 477.84, "end": 481.88, "text": "Unfortunately I'm not allowed to discuss my former life or engage in any"}, {"start": 481.88, "end": 485.12, "text": "non-platonic relations practice religion in public or eat any non-fresh"}, {"start": 485.12, "end": 487.77128205128207, "text": "unhealthy food like that found anywhere outside Subway."}, {"start": 487.77128205128207, "end": 488.88, "text": "Why are you getting all"}, {"start": 488.88, "end": 489.2620512820513, "text": "that?"}, {"start": 489.2620512820513, "end": 492.54769230769233, "text": "I wanted to stand next to you for a moment."}, {"start": 492.54769230769233, "end": 493.7702564102564, "text": "It was worth it."}, {"start": 493.7702564102564, "end": 494.84, "text": "A good book by"}, {"start": 494.84, "end": 495.9061538461538, "text": "Orwell."}, {"start": 495.9061538461538, "end": 498.8, "text": "Our veggie delight."}, {"start": 502.2, "end": 503.4132530120482, "text": "Is that you Subway?"}, {"start": 503.4132530120482, "end": 505.77590361445783, "text": "My eyesight ain't what it used to be."}, {"start": 505.77590361445783, "end": 507.5, "text": "Eat these tater tots Harry."}, {"start": 507.5, "end": 512.42, "text": "But what it's worth I think you might see more than all of us."}, {"start": 512.42, "end": 514.88, "text": "Did you see him smiling at you?"}, {"start": 514.88, "end": 517.4436363636363, "text": "Top-notch horsemanship Britta."}, {"start": 517.4436363636363, "end": 517.9563636363636, "text": "Piers."}, {"start": 517.9563636363636, "end": 519.750909090909, "text": "Sorry horsewomenship."}, {"start": 519.750909090909, "end": 520.52, "text": "Forgot it"}, {"start": 520.52, "end": 521.4231578947368, "text": "was the 90s."}, {"start": 521.4231578947368, "end": 523.2294736842106, "text": "Anyway thank you Britta."}, {"start": 523.2294736842106, "end": 526.24, "text": "I knew we could come you to help us take"}, {"start": 526.24, "end": 526.744935064935, "text": "him down."}, {"start": 526.744935064935, "end": 530.56, "text": "Yeah that's me the girl who's gonna destroy the big sandwich company"}, {"start": 530.56, "end": 533.36, "text": "with the dreamy eyes."}, {"start": 544.88, "end": 549.4104109589041, "text": "Powerful passage isn't it?"}, {"start": 549.4104109589041, "end": 555.6832876712328, "text": "She had become a physical necessity?"}, {"start": 555.6832876712328, "end": 557.6, "text": "You circled"}, {"start": 557.6, "end": 558.5194805194806, "text": "this paragraph."}, {"start": 558.5194805194806, "end": 559.9293506493507, "text": "I can't say that I did."}, {"start": 559.9293506493507, "end": 562.32, "text": "I just think it's a striking expression"}, {"start": 562.32, "end": 566.44, "text": "of love's ability to persevere within the cracks and cogs of inhuman systems."}, {"start": 566.44, "end": 568.0821052631579, "text": "Who were you Subway?"}, {"start": 568.0821052631579, "end": 569.9705263157895, "text": "Before you were Subway."}, {"start": 569.9705263157895, "end": 570.9557894736841, "text": "I can't say."}, {"start": 570.9557894736841, "end": 572.68, "text": "I have to live within"}, {"start": 572.68, "end": 573.2825316455696, "text": "the rules."}, {"start": 573.2825316455696, "end": 574.7888607594937, "text": "This identity is my life."}, {"start": 574.7888607594937, "end": 577.44, "text": "If I do this for three more years I can live"}, {"start": 577.44, "end": 577.967027027027, "text": "a real dream."}, {"start": 577.967027027027, "end": 579.385945945946, "text": "Well at least tell me what that is."}, {"start": 579.385945945946, "end": 580.44, "text": "I want to run a non-profit"}, {"start": 580.44, "end": 582.4846753246753, "text": "shelter for handicapped animals."}, {"start": 582.4846753246753, "end": 584.4654545454546, "text": "Dogs with wheels for hind legs."}, {"start": 584.4654545454546, "end": 585.36, "text": "Deaf hamsters."}, {"start": 585.36, "end": 586.41, "text": "What are cats?"}, {"start": 586.41, "end": 589.41, "text": "Only one on the top of my list but sure."}, {"start": 589.41, "end": 590.31, "text": "I should go."}, {"start": 590.31, "end": 591.96, "text": "This is getting out of"}, {"start": 591.96, "end": 593.1666666666667, "text": "bounds for me."}, {"start": 593.1666666666667, "end": 594.459523809524, "text": "You need fresh."}, {"start": 594.459523809524, "end": 599.2, "text": "You should put the small ones in the middle of the wall"}, {"start": 599.2, "end": 600.4047368421053, "text": "and hold the ceiling."}, {"start": 600.4047368421053, "end": 602.6421052631579, "text": "Why do I always have to be your Reggie?"}, {"start": 602.6421052631579, "end": 602.9289473684211, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 602.9289473684211, "end": 603.56, "text": "I wanted to"}, {"start": 603.56, "end": 606.5578947368421, "text": "make a blanket fort and you never even gave it a second thought."}, {"start": 606.5578947368421, "end": 607.12, "text": "I'm not even"}, {"start": 607.12, "end": 608.7924324324324, "text": "your sidekick I'm your under kick."}, {"start": 608.7924324324324, "end": 610.6616216216216, "text": "I never said you couldn't do anything."}, {"start": 610.6616216216216, "end": 610.76, "text": "If"}, {"start": 610.76, "end": 613.7584415584416, "text": "you want to make a blanket fort that's fine with me."}, {"start": 613.7584415584416, "end": 614.335064935065, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 614.335064935065, "end": 615.2, "text": "Just don't make"}, {"start": 615.2, "end": 618.0, "text": "a part of my pillow fort."}, {"start": 621.12, "end": 624.9, "text": "- Fine, I'll start it somewhere else."}, {"start": 624.9, "end": 626.74, "text": "Have fun stacking pillows like a baby."}, {"start": 629.74, "end": 631.88, "text": "- Jeff, are you okay?"}, {"start": 631.88, "end": 634.24, "text": "- I'm lying on campus furniture, so no."}, {"start": 634.24, "end": 635.74, "text": "- Is it about this Kim girl?"}, {"start": 638.58, "end": 642.24, "text": "- She is someone who died thinking I was a dick."}, {"start": 642.24, "end": 643.74, "text": "I can never apologize."}, {"start": 643.74, "end": 645.38, "text": "I can never change her mind."}, {"start": 645.38, "end": 647.92, "text": "That makes me a dick forever."}, {"start": 647.92, "end": 650.36, "text": "- You think that's what an apology is?"}, {"start": 650.36, "end": 653.9, "text": "A spell you cast on another person to make them forgive you?"}, {"start": 653.9, "end": 657.32, "text": "Apologies are opportunities to admit your own mistakes."}, {"start": 657.32, "end": 659.02, "text": "Apologize to her locker."}, {"start": 659.02, "end": 661.9, "text": "- But how can I apologize if I don't know what I did wrong?"}, {"start": 661.9, "end": 664.36, "text": "- Well, didn't she call you inconsiderate?"}, {"start": 665.78, "end": 668.48, "text": "Sounds to me like you know exactly what you did wrong."}, {"start": 669.94, "end": 671.28, "text": "- Leonard, what are you doing?"}, {"start": 671.28, "end": 673.62, "text": "- I'll be at Fortinade's Pillows."}, {"start": 673.62, "end": 674.82, "text": "I was gonna lie there."}, {"start": 674.82, "end": 678.16, "text": "- I was going to invest in IBM in 1952,"}, {"start": 678.16, "end": 680.32, "text": "but life is full of disappointments."}, {"start": 685.24, "end": 686.78, "text": "Eating fresh, are we?"}, {"start": 686.78, "end": 688.32, "text": "- Have you found any dirt on Subway yet?"}, {"start": 688.32, "end": 689.16, "text": "- No, nothing."}, {"start": 689.16, "end": 690.88, "text": "I should probably hang out with him more."}, {"start": 690.88, "end": 692.34, "text": "- You know what I think?"}, {"start": 692.34, "end": 693.8, "text": "I think you're falling for him."}, {"start": 693.8, "end": 694.96, "text": "- I am not."}, {"start": 694.96, "end": 696.1, "text": "Who do you think I am?"}, {"start": 696.1, "end": 697.22, "text": "I lived in New York."}, {"start": 697.22, "end": 699.26, "text": "- You never lived anywhere."}, {"start": 699.26, "end": 701.1, "text": "You're a weapon designed for sex."}, {"start": 701.1, "end": 702.38, "text": "You only think you lived in New York"}, {"start": 702.38, "end": 703.98, "text": "because I implanted your memories."}, {"start": 703.98, "end": 705.14, "text": "- Oh, Pierce, stop it."}, {"start": 705.14, "end": 706.86, "text": "Look at where we're becoming."}, {"start": 706.86, "end": 708.94, "text": "- I'm sorry we pulled you into this dirty game."}, {"start": 708.94, "end": 709.94, "text": "I want you to stop."}, {"start": 709.94, "end": 711.24, "text": "- Yeah, we're pulling you out"}, {"start": 711.24, "end": 712.9, "text": "right after your last assignment."}, {"start": 713.94, "end": 716.82, "text": "This pen is a microphone."}, {"start": 716.82, "end": 719.86, "text": "It's also a mini flask."}, {"start": 721.32, "end": 722.78, "text": "- Did you just drink ink?"}, {"start": 722.78, "end": 724.98, "text": "- Just plant this on Subway."}, {"start": 724.98, "end": 726.74, "text": "You'll never have to see him again."}, {"start": 726.74, "end": 728.66, "text": "Until then, keep him interested."}, {"start": 728.66, "end": 731.62, "text": "And for God's sake, slap some life on those dead lips."}, {"start": 736.0, "end": 736.82, "text": "- Hello, Abed."}, {"start": 737.7, "end": 739.1800000000001, "text": "How's the pillow fort going?"}, {"start": 739.1800000000001, "end": 741.46, "text": "- It's hard making something perfect, but it's worth it."}, {"start": 741.46, "end": 742.66, "text": "- Yeah, I'll remember that one."}, {"start": 742.66, "end": 743.5, "text": "I'm being given a key"}, {"start": 743.5, "end": 745.22, "text": "to the secret Guinness record holders clubhouse"}, {"start": 745.22, "end": 746.62, "text": "where I'll be hanging with those two fat guys"}, {"start": 746.62, "end": 749.38, "text": "on motorcycles and being fitted for a beard of bees."}, {"start": 749.38, "end": 750.22, "text": "- Woo!"}, {"start": 750.22, "end": 752.62, "text": "- Well, Troy, I just got off the phone with Guinness"}, {"start": 752.62, "end": 754.22, "text": "and they are sending a representative"}, {"start": 754.22, "end": 757.06, "text": "to have a look-see at your blanket fort."}, {"start": 757.06, "end": 759.22, "text": "Are we world record ready?"}, {"start": 759.22, "end": 760.04, "text": "Garrett?"}, {"start": 760.04, "end": 761.98, "text": "- We are still more than 2,000 square feet"}, {"start": 761.98, "end": 763.06, "text": "shy of the record."}, {"start": 763.06, "end": 765.98, "text": "Abed's pillow fort is the only thing standing in our way."}, {"start": 765.98, "end": 767.8199999999999, "text": "- Well, what are we gonna do here, guys?"}, {"start": 767.8199999999999, "end": 769.58, "text": "Is there a way we can connect them?"}, {"start": 769.58, "end": 771.1800000000001, "text": "- You can't connect the blanket fort to the pillow fort"}, {"start": 771.1800000000001, "end": 772.4, "text": "and still call it a pillow fort."}, {"start": 772.4, "end": 773.24, "text": "Even if you could,"}, {"start": 773.24, "end": 774.9, "text": "I'd rather see my work destroyed than compromise it."}, {"start": 774.9, "end": 775.74, "text": "- Great."}, {"start": 775.74, "end": 777.64, "text": "Abed will destroy his pillow fort"}, {"start": 777.64, "end": 780.74, "text": "and Troy will expand his blanket fort into the space."}, {"start": 780.74, "end": 782.14, "text": "Everyone wins."}, {"start": 782.14, "end": 785.34, "text": "Except Abed, but you know, not everyone can win."}, {"start": 785.34, "end": 787.0, "text": "- Is that what you want, Troy?"}, {"start": 787.0, "end": 788.24, "text": "For me to destroy my pillow fort"}, {"start": 788.24, "end": 789.58, "text": "so you can set your record?"}, {"start": 790.94, "end": 791.78, "text": "- It is."}, {"start": 792.62, "end": 794.34, "text": "- Magnitude."}, {"start": 794.34, "end": 796.46, "text": "Evacuate Fort Abed and prepare for self-destruct."}, {"start": 796.46, "end": 797.34, "text": "- Sir?"}, {"start": 797.34, "end": 798.6800000000001, "text": "- Do it."}, {"start": 798.6800000000001, "end": 799.78, "text": "We're done here."}, {"start": 799.78, "end": 800.98, "text": "- Well, Bob, Captain."}, {"start": 811.22, "end": 813.26, "text": "- Oh, subway."}, {"start": 813.26, "end": 815.58, "text": "- Britta, I was worried you wouldn't come."}, {"start": 815.58, "end": 816.94, "text": "I can't stop thinking about you."}, {"start": 816.94, "end": 817.78, "text": "- Shh."}, {"start": 821.834, "end": 823.434, "text": "- They wanted me to plant a bug on you."}, {"start": 823.434, "end": 825.074, "text": "I can't and I won't."}, {"start": 825.074, "end": 826.5939999999999, "text": "Our values, our identities,"}, {"start": 826.5939999999999, "end": 828.314, "text": "they mean nothing to me now."}, {"start": 828.314, "end": 829.814, "text": "Only the primal remains."}, {"start": 829.814, "end": 833.7939999999999, "text": "To me, you are simply a physical necessity."}, {"start": 835.914, "end": 836.7539999999999, "text": "Oh, subway."}, {"start": 840.834, "end": 842.3939999999999, "text": "- Oh, subway."}, {"start": 842.3939999999999, "end": 843.3939999999999, "text": "Oh, subway."}, {"start": 845.0939999999999, "end": 846.0939999999999, "text": "Oh, subway."}, {"start": 847.5539999999999, "end": 849.334, "text": "- Oh, no, no, this is wrong, Pierce."}, {"start": 849.334, "end": 850.6339999999999, "text": "I just wanted to open a sandwich shop."}, {"start": 850.6339999999999, "end": 851.914, "text": "I did not sign up for this."}, {"start": 851.914, "end": 853.674, "text": "- You don't want to get your hands dirty fine."}, {"start": 853.674, "end": 854.5139999999999, "text": "I will."}, {"start": 856.1139999999999, "end": 859.0339999999999, "text": "- Snow and your subway, if that is your real name."}, {"start": 873.834, "end": 878.834, "text": "- Kim, it's me, Jeff, the inconsiderate jerk."}, {"start": 879.834, "end": 881.7139999999999, "text": "Look, I don't remember hurting you"}, {"start": 881.7139999999999, "end": 884.154, "text": "and I have to assume that's what hurt you."}, {"start": 884.154, "end": 885.7539999999999, "text": "God knows what crime you committed"}, {"start": 885.7539999999999, "end": 888.1139999999999, "text": "to deserve me disregarding you entirely."}, {"start": 888.1139999999999, "end": 889.7939999999999, "text": "But whatever your crime,"}, {"start": 889.7939999999999, "end": 893.174, "text": "I think we both know the real crime is mine."}, {"start": 893.174, "end": 895.3139999999999, "text": "I'm a self-centered, shallow jackass."}, {"start": 896.5539999999999, "end": 899.7139999999999, "text": "And I just want to thank you for your note"}, {"start": 900.7739999999999, "end": 902.5739999999998, "text": "because I'm going to try and change."}, {"start": 903.834, "end": 905.4739999999999, "text": "I just wish you were here to forgive me."}, {"start": 905.4739999999999, "end": 907.8739999999999, "text": "- I am and I do."}, {"start": 909.5939999999999, "end": 910.8739999999999, "text": "I'm Kim."}, {"start": 910.8739999999999, "end": 911.8739999999999, "text": "- What?"}, {"start": 911.8739999999999, "end": 913.834, "text": "- You said Kim was dead."}, {"start": 913.834, "end": 916.334, "text": "- Because you never remember who I am."}, {"start": 916.334, "end": 918.194, "text": "First year, we hung out like 10 times"}, {"start": 918.194, "end": 920.394, "text": "and each time you introduced yourself to me,"}, {"start": 920.394, "end": 921.914, "text": "that's when I wrote that note."}, {"start": 921.914, "end": 924.1139999999999, "text": "And then today, it's like you still don't remember me"}, {"start": 924.1139999999999, "end": 927.0739999999998, "text": "and you still assume from my name that I am a girl."}, {"start": 927.0739999999998, "end": 929.0339999999999, "text": "I had no choice but to make up that awesome story"}, {"start": 929.0339999999999, "end": 931.894, "text": "about a dead chick, to hurt you like you hurt me."}, {"start": 931.894, "end": 934.1339999999999, "text": "- I am so sorry."}, {"start": 935.834, "end": 938.0739999999998, "text": "Kim, right?"}, {"start": 938.0739999999998, "end": 940.4739999999999, "text": "- Do you know how long I've waited to hear you say that?"}, {"start": 942.834, "end": 944.2339999999999, "text": "- What the hell is this crap?"}, {"start": 944.2339999999999, "end": 946.7539999999999, "text": "- Annie, this is Kim."}, {"start": 946.7539999999999, "end": 948.1139999999999, "text": "I think because he had a girl's name,"}, {"start": 948.1139999999999, "end": 949.394, "text": "I never took him seriously."}, {"start": 949.394, "end": 951.7539999999999, "text": "- It happens literally all the time, which is insane"}, {"start": 951.7539999999999, "end": 954.5939999999999, "text": "because 16% of all people named Kim are men."}, {"start": 954.5939999999999, "end": 955.5939999999999, "text": "- I'm sorry, buddy."}, {"start": 955.5939999999999, "end": 956.9739999999999, "text": "- Don't apologize to this guy."}, {"start": 956.9739999999999, "end": 958.434, "text": "- You told me to apologize."}, {"start": 958.434, "end": 960.2339999999999, "text": "- To a dead girl's locker."}, {"start": 960.2339999999999, "end": 963.6339999999999, "text": "I thought I was representing the sisterhood."}, {"start": 963.6339999999999, "end": 964.834, "text": "Thought I was teaching you a lesson"}, {"start": 964.834, "end": 968.454, "text": "about all the girls you dominate and then ignore."}, {"start": 968.454, "end": 970.914, "text": "Not to waste your energy on some weird,"}, {"start": 970.914, "end": 974.4739999999999, "text": "cloying, hypersensitive stalker with a girl's name."}, {"start": 974.4739999999999, "end": 976.5539999999999, "text": "- Hey, you're really mean."}, {"start": 976.5539999999999, "end": 978.2739999999999, "text": "- Put it in a letter, Jane Austen."}, {"start": 981.154, "end": 982.954, "text": "- Prepare to initiate protocol omega."}, {"start": 984.914, "end": 986.8739999999999, "text": "Goodbye, pillow fort."}, {"start": 986.8739999999999, "end": 988.1139999999999, "text": "You are a beautiful dream."}, {"start": 988.1139999999999, "end": 989.194, "text": "- More than a dream."}, {"start": 990.5139999999999, "end": 991.9939999999999, "text": "It's here."}, {"start": 991.9939999999999, "end": 992.834, "text": "- Who are you?"}, {"start": 992.834, "end": 994.9939999999999, "text": "- Someone who understands dedication to craftsmanship"}, {"start": 994.9939999999999, "end": 997.194, "text": "in the face of mediocrity."}, {"start": 997.194, "end": 1000.414, "text": "This world is run by the unremarkables."}, {"start": 1000.414, "end": 1002.194, "text": "Don't do what you always do a bit."}, {"start": 1002.194, "end": 1005.2739999999999, "text": "Don't corrupt the host to pacify the parasites."}, {"start": 1005.2739999999999, "end": 1007.5539999999999, "text": "Ask yourself, what if I stop worrying"}, {"start": 1007.5539999999999, "end": 1009.914, "text": "about their acceptance of me?"}, {"start": 1009.914, "end": 1013.434, "text": "What if it fell to the wretches of the world"}, {"start": 1013.434, "end": 1016.954, "text": "to keep up with the inspectors or perish?"}, {"start": 1017.9939999999999, "end": 1020.6339999999999, "text": "Now, please turn your head while I crawl away."}, {"start": 1021.674, "end": 1024.154, "text": "I'm going through some stuff right now."}, {"start": 1025.154, "end": 1026.5539999999999, "text": "I'm very insecure."}, {"start": 1029.7939999999999, "end": 1030.914, "text": "- What's going on?"}, {"start": 1030.914, "end": 1032.8339999999998, "text": "- I'll ask the questions here."}, {"start": 1032.8339999999998, "end": 1036.3739999999998, "text": "You had sex with Subway, and I recorded it."}, {"start": 1036.3739999999998, "end": 1040.434, "text": "- Oh, mm-hmm, mm-hmm, mm-hmm."}, {"start": 1040.434, "end": 1041.274, "text": "You know what?"}, {"start": 1041.274, "end": 1042.114, "text": "I'm gonna let this one slide."}, {"start": 1042.114, "end": 1042.534, "text": "- What?"}, {"start": 1042.534, "end": 1042.954, "text": "- What?"}, {"start": 1042.954, "end": 1043.954, "text": "- I know we have very strict rules"}, {"start": 1043.954, "end": 1047.434, "text": "against romantic entanglements with our corpo-humanoids,"}, {"start": 1047.434, "end": 1048.8339999999998, "text": "but at this point in time,"}, {"start": 1048.8339999999998, "end": 1051.434, "text": "we can't stop them from having hearts."}, {"start": 1051.434, "end": 1053.2939999999999, "text": "These two are clearly in love."}, {"start": 1053.2939999999999, "end": 1054.7939999999999, "text": "If they want to express that love"}, {"start": 1054.7939999999999, "end": 1057.8339999999998, "text": "in a perfectly healthy way, then, okay, hold on."}, {"start": 1059.234, "end": 1060.594, "text": "Is this what I think it is?"}, {"start": 1062.3539999999998, "end": 1063.194, "text": "That?"}, {"start": 1063.194, "end": 1065.0739999999998, "text": "Unhealthy real quick."}, {"start": 1065.0739999999998, "end": 1067.3139999999999, "text": "That, okay, that's weird."}, {"start": 1067.3139999999999, "end": 1069.914, "text": "That is well out of the mainstream."}, {"start": 1069.914, "end": 1073.154, "text": "I was raised in the Bay Area, but I'm a father now."}, {"start": 1075.3139999999999, "end": 1076.674, "text": "Subway cannot stand for that,"}, {"start": 1076.674, "end": 1079.994, "text": "and frankly, Rick, I'm surprised you did."}, {"start": 1079.994, "end": 1080.954, "text": "- My name is Subway."}, {"start": 1080.954, "end": 1081.7939999999999, "text": "- Not anymore."}, {"start": 1082.674, "end": 1084.0339999999999, "text": "The bread is stale."}, {"start": 1084.0339999999999, "end": 1084.8739999999998, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 1084.8739999999998, "end": 1085.714, "text": "- Oh my God, you-- - No!"}, {"start": 1085.714, "end": 1087.234, "text": "- Subway, I love you!"}, {"start": 1087.234, "end": 1088.0739999999998, "text": "- Vida!"}, {"start": 1088.0739999999998, "end": 1088.914, "text": "- Shut up."}, {"start": 1088.914, "end": 1089.754, "text": "- Who caught you?"}, {"start": 1089.754, "end": 1092.0339999999999, "text": "- Well, if that'll be all, I'll be on my way."}, {"start": 1093.754, "end": 1095.394, "text": "Someone could hand me my jacket."}, {"start": 1096.7939999999999, "end": 1099.8339999999998, "text": "This is right over there on the co-rack next to the door."}, {"start": 1099.8339999999998, "end": 1102.514, "text": "If somebody could just hand it to me, that would be great."}, {"start": 1105.542, "end": 1106.942, "text": "- I guess I'm confused."}, {"start": 1106.942, "end": 1108.6619999999998, "text": "Why don't you just grab it on your way out the door?"}, {"start": 1108.6619999999998, "end": 1110.482, "text": "- You know what, now I'm not leaving."}, {"start": 1110.482, "end": 1112.542, "text": "Now I'm just going to sit for a while"}, {"start": 1112.542, "end": 1115.742, "text": "and focus on how unacceptable today was."}, {"start": 1117.1019999999999, "end": 1121.1019999999999, "text": "- Jeff, I wanted to apologize."}, {"start": 1121.1019999999999, "end": 1124.822, "text": "I never realized I had my own issues regarding gender roles,"}, {"start": 1124.822, "end": 1127.822, "text": "and it was certainly unfair of me to take them out on Kim."}, {"start": 1127.822, "end": 1129.3419999999999, "text": "- Hmm."}, {"start": 1129.3419999999999, "end": 1130.182, "text": "Who's Kim?"}, {"start": 1132.382, "end": 1134.982, "text": "- Corporate America has destroyed love."}, {"start": 1134.982, "end": 1135.6408235294118, "text": "- Again?"}, {"start": 1135.6408235294118, "end": 1136.382, "text": "- Subway!"}, {"start": 1138.182, "end": 1141.542, "text": "Oh, I'm sorry, I thought you were someone else."}, {"start": 1141.542, "end": 1142.862, "text": "- Vida, you silly."}, {"start": 1142.862, "end": 1144.6619999999998, "text": "It is me, Subway."}, {"start": 1144.6619999999998, "end": 1145.502, "text": "- What?"}, {"start": 1145.502, "end": 1147.902, "text": "- I had a great time with you last night in the pillow fort,"}, {"start": 1147.902, "end": 1151.222, "text": "the one exception being the Deviant Sex Act you initiated"}, {"start": 1151.222, "end": 1152.6819999999998, "text": "without my consent."}, {"start": 1155.782, "end": 1156.6219999999998, "text": "- Eat fresh."}, {"start": 1159.1819999999998, "end": 1159.6019999999999, "text": "- Oh, jeez."}, {"start": 1159.6019999999999, "end": 1160.022, "text": "- Oh, jeez."}, {"start": 1160.022, "end": 1162.822, "text": "- There is a situation developing in the study room."}, {"start": 1162.822, "end": 1164.742, "text": "I would elaborate, but I am out of breath"}, {"start": 1164.742, "end": 1166.502, "text": "because I walk here very briskly."}, {"start": 1166.502, "end": 1168.742, "text": "(panting)"}, {"start": 1168.742, "end": 1171.402, "text": "(crowd yelling)"}, {"start": 1175.482, "end": 1176.782, "text": "- What's going on here?"}, {"start": 1176.782, "end": 1178.262, "text": "Bob, Ed won't tear down his fort."}, {"start": 1178.262, "end": 1180.062, "text": "- I shouldn't have to compromise my craftsmanship"}, {"start": 1180.062, "end": 1181.222, "text": "to placate mediocrity."}, {"start": 1181.222, "end": 1182.1019999999999, "text": "- Mediocrity?"}, {"start": 1182.1019999999999, "end": 1183.982, "text": "- Okay, boys, boys."}, {"start": 1183.982, "end": 1186.262, "text": "The Guinness rep will be here in two days."}, {"start": 1186.262, "end": 1189.6219999999998, "text": "Can we just flip a coin to decide who has to back down?"}, {"start": 1189.6219999999998, "end": 1190.3319999999999, "text": "- No."}, {"start": 1190.3319999999999, "end": 1191.042, "text": "- No."}, {"start": 1191.042, "end": 1193.342, "text": "Well, I'm Dean, so I'm making the call."}, {"start": 1196.1419999999998, "end": 1197.822, "text": "The pillow fort comes down."}, {"start": 1197.822, "end": 1198.982, "text": "- You stay back."}, {"start": 1198.982, "end": 1200.222, "text": "- Watch it, Starbirds."}, {"start": 1200.222, "end": 1202.022, "text": "- Name is Alex."}, {"start": 1202.022, "end": 1204.362, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 1207.782, "end": 1208.782, "text": "- This is work."}, {"start": 1208.782, "end": 1211.1219999999998, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 1226.542, "end": 1227.382, "text": "- Back, back, back."}, {"start": 1227.382, "end": 1228.222, "text": "- Go."}, {"start": 1228.222, "end": 1229.462, "text": "- Back, back, back, back in the fort."}, {"start": 1229.462, "end": 1232.6619999999998, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 1232.6619999999998, "end": 1233.502, "text": "- To be continued."}, {"start": 1233.502, "end": 1236.262, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 1237.782, "end": 1240.542, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 1244.406, "end": 1246.406, "text": "- Sir, it appears that Troy Barnes' blanket fort"}, {"start": 1246.406, "end": 1249.0459999999998, "text": "may go to war with a bed in a deer's pillow fort."}, {"start": 1249.0459999999998, "end": 1250.406, "text": "- Of course."}, {"start": 1250.406, "end": 1252.5659999999998, "text": "Soon Troy and Abed will be torn asunder"}, {"start": 1252.5659999999998, "end": 1255.5659999999998, "text": "and an unencumbered Troy will turn to his destiny."}, {"start": 1256.4859999999999, "end": 1259.0059999999999, "text": "The air conditioning repair school."}, {"start": 1259.0059999999999, "end": 1261.0459999999998, "text": "- You are a cold-blooded man, sir."}, {"start": 1261.0459999999998, "end": 1262.7259999999999, "text": "- Yes."}, {"start": 1262.7259999999999, "end": 1265.2459999999999, "text": "How unfortunate for Troy and Abed."}, {"start": 1269.0059999999999, "end": 1270.5259999999998, "text": "- See you at band practice."}, {"start": 1275.2859999999998, "end": 1278.0459999999998, "text": "(dramatic music)"}]}